    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2549f1baf5b4a53d493d907",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "千明代表称霸“皋月赏”后，\n世人都期待她能获得达成经典三冠的荣誉。\n然而，她本人对这个称号毫无兴趣。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5acd9be3679fde1d08e92539db7585f6ae71027df5509ff7276bc3dea99fe857",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1057/storytimeline_501057411.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
