    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3dcc3434372f18f4247315d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "世人都期待千明代表能够成为德比赛马娘，\n但对她来说重要的不是称号，\n而是能够照着自己的想法奔跑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe5427e590d7f34bed9a96a9f3360f854f281a59ccae0b5c81c9484e3b61b480",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1057/storytimeline_501057412.json",
      "json_path": [
