    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e85fd86cefc8e10e798c1f3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向日本德比",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4074326c9093437fbf37c8e5b00d67df67963c2eed1109506df4b11f06953bc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1057/storytimeline_501057412.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a079554d94060f2d0c759fa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "千明代表告诉葛城王牌。\n她一路走来，\n就是想和葛城王牌这个好劲敌一起享受比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "691fc69ee7220b58a38abcc0606bc8efeebdc9318d72b10d98cfeb8dcdead51a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1057/storytimeline_501057413.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00ecad4b85c3d95c112d18c5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而，葛城王牌只将她视为一道高墙，\n并只想着要超越她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4fdd7edebfc12c9059584c64e0830a95f8b08cbec3d0db797a2b9a532416b82d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1057/storytimeline_501057413.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28131a9f23f037b558a29ec9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "葛城王牌眼里只有超越千明代表这件事，\n而不是赢得胜利。\n这是现在最让千明代表感到不甘心的事情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "332471d7dbbc4d7be05c48031b2e64dac7172b7938bb81129b0e8272a9040ae7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1057/storytimeline_501057413.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c81a0136d0b67eabee0babb4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "千明代表宣告──\n她今天要让葛城王牌输得一败涂地，\n使其露出爱造反的真面目。",
      "source_fingerprint": "18f94c0b1ad30907124cae1f33357316c91b056fd7557f54123ac6a604d57eef",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1057/storytimeline_501057413.json",
      "json_path": [
