      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "鲁道夫象征于前阵子拿下了\n“皋月赏”和“日本德比”。\n达成二冠，成为了不败的二冠赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a4f326d0b459fb2beb481f3eb49dcf7f279fa07b1f09b4f1d00d23444d076d6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
