    {
      "uid": "zhcn:feaa8fd6e0dad6e2209797d1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "世人将自由奔放又大胆的千明代表\n评价为“惊人”，同时将以标准方式获胜的\n鲁道夫象征评价为“强大”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "073047a3e7e76f74e7caec5c71368acdeac9590f68afb59192f953b163e33bab",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
