    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cd3581a47c9a94c4290d59a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了今后着想，训练员认为自己多少要\n能够预测她的心情。于是，\n他决定透过和她一起散步，加深对她的理解。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f6cb1f377d6b586dc48fe4e25b4d89640472f51235f05e89d6d9f312c203b32",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
