    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba70ffbd2d492350d9327d1c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "此时，手纲小姐来询问两人的下一个目标竞赛。\n千明代表表示自己想和实力坚强的选手一起比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "90478b6c775c35075bf31790f80c36b0e679ba1eb7351bbc324af6405b88a0b8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1057/storytimeline_501057418.json",
      "json_path": [
