    {
      "uid": "zhcn:debc77b18c6abe74401acc24",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是，两人将下一个目标定为从春天开始的\n经典赛前哨战“共同通信杯”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "157d140ab005321afa8859f0a7335516f2a11a01efed6749a696605d80bea099",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
