      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "此时，葛城王牌突然跑来宣战，\n要千明代表在“皋月赏”与她一决胜负。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b97be3daa538889a8d6d4c2aa840c70e9daf9bdad8a513812a6ed5239a273c93",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
