      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "记者认为葛城王牌的等级，\n还不足以挑战千明代表。\n但她激动地表示自己会颠覆等级给大家看。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eabb14aacb70ba17892c71eb3574d37d6d4858dbc7004cf18df42139285f2656",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
