      "uid": "zhcn:449e608f3a03559f74a4f310",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她的宣言让千明代表感到雀跃不已。\n千明代表宣告将挑战经典三冠路线，\n和葛城王牌对决──下一个目标是“皋月赏”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "96c19842ca2465d2894c29382e5650bd37601abf26bfeb310dca240dd541dd96",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
