    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:926c086e9d1646642a533874",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即使赛场的状态是罕见的极差，\n千明代表依然不受影响，称霸了“皋月赏”。\n观众们都对她的表现赞不绝口。",
      "source_fingerprint": "079c04bb65cb13dd15b4e943cd6ba2678c5392c15ae121e2edcadcd468e38117",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1057/storytimeline_501057420.json",
      "json_path": [
