    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a126b3ba3388055ce81965be",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "下一个目标是“日本德比”。\n这个大舞台集结了同世代备受期待的选手，\n千明代表十分期待与她们展开热烈的激战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8249fbdc4fece0cf45d47cfd9f275fc052e359d3111af79089343371de32acf0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
